  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 1, 'Sit down for every meal today, even a snack, even for two minutes. Notice which one you would normally have eaten standing.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 2, 'Set the table for yourself tonight: a plate, a real napkin, a glass of water, before the food is ready.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 3, 'Put your fork down between bites at dinner and pick it up again only after you have swallowed.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 4, 'Eat breakfast at a table this morning instead of at the counter or on the way out the door.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 5, 'Take your lunch to a different spot at work, a bench, a break room, a windowsill, and eat it there from start to finish.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 6, 'Before your first bite of any meal today, take one slow breath and look at what is on the plate.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 7, 'Notice the temperature of your coffee or tea with the first sip, and drink the whole cup while it is still warm.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 8, 'Buy one piece of fruit that is in season right now and eat it slowly, outside if you can.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 9, 'Cook something with three ingredients tonight and give the cooking your full attention.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 10, 'Eat one meal today with someone else, in person, and let the conversation set the pace.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 11, 'Serve dinner on your nicest plates tonight for no reason at all.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 12, 'Chew the first bite of lunch until you can name two flavors in it.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 13, 'Turn off the TV for dinner tonight and see what fills the quiet.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 14, 'Pause halfway through a meal today and ask yourself how the food tastes now compared with the first bite.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 15, 'Peel an orange slowly and notice the smell on your fingers before you eat a single segment.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 16, 'Make your snack a small event: put it in a bowl, sit down, and finish it before you go back to what you were doing.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 17, 'Light a candle at dinner tonight, even if you are eating alone.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 18, 'Wait until everyone at the table is seated before anyone starts eating tonight.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 19, 'Eat lunch without reading anything today, no screen, no paper, no labels on the packaging.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 20, 'Drink your morning coffee sitting down, and make it the only thing you do until the cup is empty.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 21, 'Take an extra minute to arrange your plate before you eat: food in the center, a little space around it.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 22, 'Notice the sound of your meal today: the crunch, the clink of the spoon, the room around you.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 23, 'Eat one thing today with your hands, bread, an apple, a piece of cheese, and feel its texture before you taste it.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 24, 'Pack tomorrow''s lunch tonight and include one thing you are genuinely looking forward to.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 25, 'Sit for two minutes after you finish dinner instead of getting up right away.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 26, 'Warm your plate or bowl before serving tonight so the food stays hot while you eat slowly.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 27, 'Eat your snack this afternoon at a table, not at your desk, and give it your full attention for as long as it lasts.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 28, 'Name the colors on your plate before you start eating tonight.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 29, 'Ask someone what their favorite thing to eat was as a child, and listen to the whole answer over a meal.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 30, 'Stir a pot of something slow tonight, oatmeal, soup, a sauce, and stay in the kitchen while it cooks.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 31, 'Set your fork down and take a sip of water three times during lunch today.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 32, 'Eat dinner at the table tonight even if it is takeout, and put the food on real plates.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 33, 'Rest your hands in your lap for one breath between courses or helpings tonight, and let the meal have a middle.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 34, 'Buy a loaf of bread from a bakery and eat one slice slowly, plain or with butter, sitting down.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 35, 'Smell your food before you taste it at each meal today, even if it is just a sandwich.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 36, 'Invite a coworker to eat lunch with you away from both your desks.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 37, 'Make a pot of tea instead of a single cup tonight and pour a second one before you get up.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 38, 'Cut your food into smaller pieces than usual at dinner and see how it changes your pace.'),
  ('slowing-down-at-meals', 39, 'Sit facing a window while you eat breakfast this morning and look out between bites.'),
